  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Fix stack buffer overrun and SQL injection in refint contrib module\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-6637.patch: Fix stack buffer overrun and\n       SQL injection in refint contrib module, plus follow-up segfault fix\n       in check_foreign_key() when a CASCADE update key value is NULL\n     - CVE-2026-6637\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Fix format-string memory disclosure via crafted time zone in timeofday() (also harden pg_strftime() error handling)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-6474.patch: Fix format-string memory disclosure via crafted time zone in timeofday() (also harden pg_strftime() error handling)\n     - CVE-2026-6474\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Use timingsafe_bcmp() in MD5 password and RADIUS authentication paths to prevent timing side-channel\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-6478.patch: Use timingsafe_bcmp() in MD5 password and RADIUS authentication paths to prevent timing side-channel\n     - CVE-2026-6478",
